{"unit_id":"oobitoooo__dsh-risk-gate#card-zh","repo":"oobitoooo/dsh-risk-gate","commit":"7266251b53c071d46aadcbab0142d4b9e94c7dae","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-risk-gate 是面向 DSH Desktop 与 dsh web 的插件，为 shell、代码执行和文件修改类工具接入可配置的规则匹配与用户确认流程。它通过 tools/pre-execute 和工具 guard 检查调用参数；命中规则时暂停该次调用，并在用户消息中收到对应编号后允许原调用重试。策略文件可热加载，也支持限时授权窗口。插件还提供 risk_gate 工具查看规则、待确认项、状态和审计记录，并将策略与运行状态保存在本机 DSH_HOME 目录。适合希望在 DSH 工作流中为特定工具调用加入明确确认步骤的用户；无需额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:884-961","lib/index.js:963-985","lib/index.js:801-869"]}
{"unit_id":"oobitoooo__dsh-risk-gate#card-en","repo":"oobitoooo/dsh-risk-gate","commit":"7266251b53c071d46aadcbab0142d4b9e94c7dae","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-risk-gate adds rules and user confirmation to DSH tool calls. Matching shell, code, or file calls pause for a user code and may then be retried once. Policies hot reload. The risk_gate tool shows status, pending items, and audit records. State is stored under DSH_HOME. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:884-961","lib/index.js:963-985","lib/index.js:801-869"]}
