{"unit_id":"oobitoooo__dsh-risk-gate#feature-confirm","repo":"oobitoooo/dsh-risk-gate","commit":"7266251b53c071d46aadcbab0142d4b9e94c7dae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-risk-gate 的功能「工具调用确认」：命中配置规则的 shell、代码或文件调用会暂停并显示确认编号；用户消息包含有效编号后，原调用可在有效期内重试一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-52","lib/index.js:801-869"]}
